# Source: Ventrax AV4 report. Acceptance specification; execution is verified separately.
Feature: Consumption monitoring and Pro reports

  Scenario: Return consumption for an authorized meter
    Given a user is authenticated and has permission to view a meter
    And the meter has cumulative readings in the requested period
    When the user requests the consumption summary
    Then the service returns the calculated consumption and estimated cost

  Scenario: Deny a Pro report without an active entitlement
    Given an authenticated user has no active Pro subscription
    When the user requests a consolidated report
    Then the service returns a forbidden response

  Scenario: Reuse a cached report
    Given a Pro report has already been generated for the same account and period
    When the user submits the same query
    Then the service may return the report from Redis without storing a duplicate
